<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-PARIS OPEN FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PARIS OPEN FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Paris Open final on</p>
<p>Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>12-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat 4-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia)</p>
<p>6-2 6-4 7-5</p>
